# Shared standards

- Write in plain English the client can read.
- Keep each fact in one file. Link to that file instead of copying it.
- Stay inside the current issue.
- In files, commit messages, and pull requests, do not include unpublished prices, internal hostnames, hosting details, internal notes, or tool or model names.
- Follow the behaviour rules in [.cursor/rules/](../rules/).
- Follow the test rule in [tests.mdc](../rules/tests.mdc).
- Make a change the way the [project guide](../../AGENTS.md) describes.
- Summarize it with [pr-summary.md](../commands/pr-summary.md).
- Role files are listed in [README.md](README.md).
